   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# \ud83c\udf9b LoRA Merge Studio - SatoDive\n**Preview every LoRA on its own, mix them, save a brand-new LoRA.**\n\n1. **Models** (yellow) - pick UNET / text encoder / VAE in the native loaders.\n2. **Setup** - choose the architecture: steps, CFG and sampler fill in by themselves.\n3. **LoRA Slots** - pick a LoRA (\ud83d\udd0e *Browse* shows pictures) and press **\u25b6 Preview this LoRA**.\n4. **Merge Studio** - pick a method (the purple card explains it), move the mixer, **\u25b6 Preview merge**.\n5. **\ud83d\udcbe Merge & Save LoRA** \u2192 `models/loras/SatoDive/`.\n\n**Want more LoRAs?** Double-click the canvas \u2192 type *LoRA Slot* \u2192 connect its **lora** output to the free `lora_\u2026` input of the Merge Studio. A new input appears every time (up to 10)."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# \ud83c\udf9b LoRA Merge Studio - SatoDive\n**Preview every LoRA on its own, mix them, save a brand-new LoRA.**\n\n1. **Models** (yellow) - pick UNET / text encoder / VAE in the native loaders.\n2. **Setup** - choose the architecture: steps, CFG and sampler fill in by themselves.\n3. **LoRA Slots** - pick a LoRA (\ud83d\udd0e *Browse* shows pictures) and press **\u25b6 Preview this LoRA**.\n4. **Merge Studio** - pick a method (the purple card explains it), move the mixer, **\u25b6 Preview merge**.\n5. **\ud83d\udcbe Merge & Save LoRA** \u2192 `models/loras/SatoDive/`.\n\n**Want more LoRAs?** Double-click the canvas \u2192 type *LoRA Slot* \u2192 connect its **lora** output to the free `lora_\u2026` input of the Merge Studio. A new input appears every time (up to 10)."
   },
   "color": "#2a2a35",
   "bgcolor": "#1b1b24"
