   "widgets_values": [
    "### 1 \u00b7 Models (native ComfyUI loaders)\nUse the normal loaders - change any file whenever you want.\n\n- **Load Diffusion Model:** `flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors`\n- **Load CLIP:** `qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors` - type **flux2**\n- **Load VAE:** `full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors`\n\n\u26a0 These are the official file names - **select your own files** after opening. If a name is missing, ComfyUI may silently pick another file: the Setup card turns **red** when a file doesn't match the architecture."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "### 1 \u00b7 Models (native ComfyUI loaders)\nUse the normal loaders - change any file whenever you want.\n\n- **Load Diffusion Model:** `flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors`\n- **Load CLIP:** `qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors` - type **flux2**\n- **Load VAE:** `full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors`\n\n\u26a0 These are the official file names - **select your own files** after opening. If a name is missing, ComfyUI may silently pick another file: the Setup card turns **red** when a file doesn't match the architecture."
