   "widgets_values": [
    "### 2 \u00b7 Setup\nPrompt + sampler used by **all** previews.\n\n- Changing **architecture** fills steps / CFG / sampler with the official settings.\n- Keep **seed = fixed**: then tweaking the merge only re-renders the merge, not every slot.\n- **isolated_previews ON** (default): every node reloads the model first, so each preview shows *exactly* its own LoRA.\n- Turbo / distilled models: leave **negative** empty."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "### 2 \u00b7 Setup\nPrompt + sampler used by **all** previews.\n\n- Changing **architecture** fills steps / CFG / sampler with the official settings.\n- Keep **seed = fixed**: then tweaking the merge only re-renders the merge, not every slot.\n- **isolated_previews ON** (default): every node reloads the model first, so each preview shows *exactly* its own LoRA.\n- Turbo / distilled models: leave **negative** empty."
   },
