   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "### 3 \u00b7 LoRA Slots - one per LoRA\n- **\u25b6 Preview this LoRA** renders with *only this LoRA* (*Before / after* puts the base model next to it).\n- **Applied \u2713 N weights** = the LoRA really changes the model. \u2717 = wrong architecture.\n- **\u24d8 Info** = Civitai pictures, base model, trigger words (click **\u2295** to add one to the prompt), your notes and strength range.\n- **\ud83d\udd0e Browse** = pick a LoRA from a picture gallery.\n- The slot's **strength** is also used by the merge (when *use_slot_strengths* is on)."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "### 3 \u00b7 LoRA Slots - one per LoRA\n- **\u25b6 Preview this LoRA** renders with *only this LoRA* (*Before / after* puts the base model next to it).\n- **Applied \u2713 N weights** = the LoRA really changes the model. \u2717 = wrong architecture.\n- **\u24d8 Info** = Civitai pictures, base model, trigger words (click **\u2295** to add one to the prompt), your notes and strength range.\n- **\ud83d\udd0e Browse** = pick a LoRA from a picture gallery.\n- The slot's **strength** is also used by the merge (when *use_slot_strengths* is on)."
   },
   "color": "#2a2a35",
   "bgcolor": "#1b1b24"
  },
