   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "### 4 \u00b7 Merge Studio - quick recipes\n- **Character + style:** *Blend - keep everything*, mixer A 1.0 / B 0.8.\n- **Layout from A, look from B:** tab A \u2192 **Composition**, tab B \u2192 **Style & detail**.\n- **Looks muddy / LoRAs fighting:** *Smart blend (TIES)*.\n- **Want MORE style change:** *Bold mix (DARE-TIES)*, keep_ratio 0.3 - 0.6.\n- **Smaller file to share:** *Blend - smaller file (SVD)*, output_rank 32 - 64.\n- **M** mutes a LoRA, **S** solos it - quick A/B testing.\n- **\ud83d\udcbe Merge & Save LoRA** never overwrites: `name_001`, `name_002`\u2026"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "### 4 \u00b7 Merge Studio - quick recipes\n- **Character + style:** *Blend - keep everything*, mixer A 1.0 / B 0.8.\n- **Layout from A, look from B:** tab A \u2192 **Composition**, tab B \u2192 **Style & detail**.\n- **Looks muddy / LoRAs fighting:** *Smart blend (TIES)*.\n- **Want MORE style change:** *Bold mix (DARE-TIES)*, keep_ratio 0.3 - 0.6.\n- **Smaller file to share:** *Blend - smaller file (SVD)*, output_rank 32 - 64.\n- **M** mutes a LoRA, **S** solos it - quick A/B testing.\n- **\ud83d\udcbe Merge & Save LoRA** never overwrites: `name_001`, `name_002`\u2026"
   },
   "color": "#2a2a35",
